; CompatRuntime.def - Module-definition file for CompatRuntime.dll
; All compatibility APIs are exported under their original Windows names so
; that CompatPatch can redirect imports transparently. Exports are driven
; by this file (not __declspec(dllexport)) to avoid C2375/C2491 linkage
; conflicts when redefining SDK-declared APIs.

